---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Financial Planning & Wealth Management Tool India | Arthavi",
  description: "Free DIY Financial Planning and Wealth Management tool. Track your net worth, manage assets, and act as your own Financial Advisor with Arthavi.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords="financial planning, wealth management, financial advisor, net worth tracker, asset management india, personal finance tool" schema={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Financial Planning India","description":"Free DIY Financial Planning and Wealth Management tool. Track your net worth, manage assets, and act as your own Financial Advisor.","url":"https://arthavi.com/financial-planning"})} breadcrumb={{items:[{name:"Home",url:"https://arthavi.com/"},{name:"Financial Planning",url:"https://arthavi.com/financial-planning"}]}}>

    

    <main class="container">
        <section class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>DIY Financial Planning & Wealth Management</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                You don't always need an expensive financial advisor. <br>Arthavi gives you the data to manage your own
                wealth.
            </p>
        </section>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <h2>The Pillars of Financial Planning</h2>
            <p>True <strong>financial planning</strong> isn't just about picking hot stocks. It's about having a
                holistic view of your financial health. It involves budgeting, saving, investing, and constant
                monitoring.</p>

            <h3>1. Know Your Net Worth</h3>
            <p>The first step in <strong>wealth management</strong> is knowing exactly what you own vs. what you owe.
                Arthavi aggregates your assets (Mutual Funds, Stocks) to give you a real-time Net Worth figure.</p>

            <h3>2. Asset Allocation</h3>
            <p>Are you over-exposed to equity? Do you have enough debt instruments? A balanced portfolio is key to risk
                management. Our dashboard visualizes your asset distribution so you can rebalance like a pro.</p>

            <h2>Be Your Own Financial Advisor</h2>
            <p>Hiring a <strong>financial advisor</strong> can be expensive, and they often come with conflicts of
                interest (commissions). With the right tools, you can take charge.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> See hidden costs and actual returns (XIRR).</li>
                <li><strong>Control:</strong> Make decisions based on data, not sales pitches.</li>
                <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> Unlike human advisors, Arthavi doesn't judge or upsell.</li>
            </ul>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                <h3>Master Your Wealth Management</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">Simple, powerful, free.</p>
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Start Planning</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
